# Living Brain, Mechanical Marvel is itself a non-Equipment artifact its controller controls (an artifact creature, Robot Villain): at the beginning of combat Bot1 targets it, and it
# stays a Robot Villain artifact creature (the text names no creature type, so its own are neither replaced nor added to), its 3/3 base set again (a 3/3 already) and it untaps.

